OL,3,GNEWSAFA technical director wins Make a
OL,4,ADifference Award
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe FA's women's technical director
OL,7,Ftook home a BBC Radio Somerset Make a
OL,8,FDifference Award for running a
OL,9,Fcommunity football club.
OL,11,FGavin Step, who won the Active Award,
OL,12,Fstarted Huish Tigers FC in Taunton 10
OL,13,Fyears ago when his son was
OL,14,Ffive-years-old as a way for him to have
OL,15,Fa kick about with his friends.
OL,17,FStep is no stranger to football as his
OL,18,Fprofessional role sees him support the
OL,19,FLionesses alongside manager Sarina
OL,20,FWiegman.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
