OL,3,GNEWSAFA technical director wins Make a
OL,4,ADifference Award
OL,5,
OL,6,FThirty-two finalists were recognised at
OL,7,FTaunton's Brewhouse theatre on Sunday
OL,8,F20 September for going above and beyond
OL,9,Fto help others, with eight winners
OL,10,Fannounced on the night.
